Allowed values for the `nature` field, in display order.

To customise the vocabulary, edit the `list` field above (source file: `src/base-fields/vocab/nature.tid`), then add the matching entries to `vocab/icons.multids` and to `language/<lang>/vocab.multids`. A value with no translation falls back to its own slug; a value with no icon simply renders without one.
